" but its better that your plugin performs that becuse usually additional "
"data will need to be set or you will have to add code using hooks/filters. "
"Plugin vendors sometimes explicitly block checkout for payment methods that "
"are not pre-defined/pre-allowed by them. In that case you will have to "
"contact them."
